 "text": "Hello, how are things going? Popcorn, crisps, bananas, apples, pears, watermelon chunks, orange chunks, walnuts, and squeezy tube of peanut butter or trail mix. Popcorn and trail mix are great snacks for that. Popcorn is the easy win. You just toss it into your bag and it stays crisp. trail mix is nice, but it tends to soak up moisture. Skip anything with baking soda or baking powder. It'll go flat in your bag. If you want one dish that's easy to share, a big tray bake can be great. Pour sauce in a tray, bake, and everyone gets a slice.",
